{"font":{"id":"c5c0d08a-e75f-4d18-9eb9-9b365aa79bca","name":"Sora","version":"2.0","script":"latin","features":[{"name":null,"tag":"aalt","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"case","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"ccmp","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"dlig","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"dnom","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"frac","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"liga","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"locl","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"numr","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"ordn","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"salt","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"sups","on_by_default":false},{"name":null,"tag":"tnum","on_by_default":false},{"name":"Alternate I, J, P, Q, and R","tag":"ss01","on_by_default":false}],"category":"Sans","languages":"","is_new":false,"inserted_at":"2022-05-23T07:41:38Z","publisher":null,"designers":[{"links":[{"name":"Twitter","url":"https://twitter.com/Jonathan Barnbrook"}],"name":"Jonathan Barnbrook","bio":"Jonathan Barnbrook's bio Bio"},{"links":[{"name":"Twitter","url":"https://twitter.com/Julián Moncada"}],"name":"Julián Moncada","bio":"Julián Moncada's bio Bio"}],"font_tags":[{"name":"Legible"},{"name":"Logotype"},{"name":"Websites"},{"name":"Products"}],"trials_enabled":null,"native_name":null,"is_shortlisted":null,"is_hot":false,"is_top":false,"related_families":null,"views":0,"views_recent":0,"slug":"sora","display_publisher_as_designer":false,"license_type":"sil_ofl","show_latin_metrics":true,"story":"<div>SORA is a typeface family commissioned for the <a href=\"https://sora.org/\">SORA</a> decentralised autonomous economy as a custom solution for branding and interface design. SORAMITSU, the developer of SORA, is a boutique Japanese technology company specialising in developing blockchain technologies and well-known for creating the first central bank digital currency using Hyperledger Iroha for the central bank of Cambodia. SORA, meaning sky in Japanese, is focused on empowering projects that benefit society by delivering new goods and services.<br><br></div><div>The SORA typeface was designed to capture SORAMITSU's spirit and heritage and is highly optimised for user interfaces. The outcome is a type family with cues of low-resolution aesthetics and early screen typography but without nostalgia, as every decision was considered towards the crisp digital environment of today. The particularly big x-height combined with evidently generous counters turns the family into a convenient tool for app and web interfaces, where clarity and effectiveness at any size is an imperative. Therefore giving us a neutral, yet distinctive, sans serif typeface with excellent legibility across various mediums.<br><br></div><div>SORA is licensed under the SIL Open Font License. You can find more details about this project&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/sora-xor/sora-font\">here</a>.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>","axes":[{"name":"Weight","property":"wght","range_left":100.0,"range_right":800.0,"range_default":400.0}],"styles":[{"default":false,"id":"ab89c0cf-e7a9-458d-8505-3ab1b4f54b43","file":"//cdn.fontshare.com/wf/5GEIVEALDZLZ3IDOL7RXBQAAQCRQVNL7/NJCRGNPK5OHZBKO77MGV3BZRMHS2NSWO/ON3D4TO4RODYPXXVC6UMBH6EMM2QEN4R","weight":{"label":"Thin","name":"Thin","number":100,"weight":100,"native_name":null},"properties":{"ascending_leading":970,"body_height":null,"cap_height":730,"descending_leading":-200,"max_char_width":1368,"x_height":520,"y_max":1152,"y_min":-290},"is_variable":false,"is_italic":false},{"default":false,"id":"b317b2c9-6bd5-4cc7-8db7-51a011f35355","file":"//cdn.fontshare.com/wf/BY7CSVKWXPJIHNLBVH6WCBSJSYLJ32VL/JKXLTV7PGYXSEPQ724ENUVVXDRFFY2LO/A7G6YGATNPEXCGUPDPRRUWF7MCU7VWFI","weight":{"label":"Thin Italic","name":"ThinItalic","number":101,"weight":100,"native_name":null},"properties":{"ascending_leading":970,"body_height":null,"cap_height":730,"descending_leading":-200,"max_char_width":1368,